
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Dimon Connect</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;600;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body>

  <header class="logo-wrap">
    <div class="diamond"><div class="diamond-inner"><div class="diamond-core"></div></div></div>
    <h1>Dimon <span>Connect</span></h1>
  </header>

  <div class="search-box">
    <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#c9dcea" stroke-width="2.5"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="6.5"/><path d="M20 20L16.5 16.5"/></svg>
    <input type="text" placeholder="Buscar servicios...">
  </div>

  <div class="top-actions">
    <button class="pill">Idiomas</button>
  </div>

  <section class="map-section">
    <img src="mapa.png" alt="Mapa mundial Dimon Connect" class="map-img">
  </section>

  <nav class="buttons">
    <button class="pill">Brindar mi Servicio</button>
    <button class="pill">Servicios Ofrecidos</button>
    <button class="pill">Servicios Solicitados</button>
    <button class="pill">Contactos</button>
    <button class="pill">Prontatos</button>
    <button class="pill">Proyectos</button>
    <button class="pill">Agenda</button>
    <button class="pill">Actividad Reciente</button>
  </nav>

  <div class="download-wrap">
    <button class="pill descargar">Dercargar App</button>
  </div>

  <section class="info">
    <h3>QQué es Dimon <span>Connect?</span></h3>
    <p>Plataforma para conectar servicios autónomos<br>de forma rápida, segura y organizada.</p>
    <a href="#" class="como">¿Cómo funciona?</a>
  </section>

  <footer>
    <div class="foot-left">
      <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#a9c3d1" stroke-width="1.2"><path d="M12 2L3 6v6c0 5 3.8 9.7 9 10 5.2-.3 9-5 9-10V6l-9-4z"/><path d="M12 7v6M10 11h4"/></svg>
      <div class="links">
        <a href="#">Normas de Seguridad</a> | <a href="#">Informacion Legal</a> | <a href="#">Términos y Condiciones</a> | <a href="#">Política de Privacidad</a> | <a href="#">Contacto</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="dola">Dola AI</div>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>